# Package F "Sweet Revenge": Stromberg hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(sweet_revenge), sweet_revenge_paid, sweet_revenge_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('sweet_revenge_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('sweet_revenge_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(sweet_revenge)') && HasItem('bd_master')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(sweet_revenge)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Shani Kell. Biggest braindance star in the dome. She walked out on her contract, and she took her last master recording with her. Terra Vitae is hiding her.
#
o_text: You want the recording.
o_id: sweet_revenge_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: sweet_revenge_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: The master. Her makeup case, at the commune; she keeps the key. Five hundred. And leave her face alone, it's worth more than you are.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(sweet_revenge)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Terra Vitae. The master recording. My lawyers are patient. I'm not.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (He takes it with both hands.) Every second of her. Do you know what a dead star sells for? Twice what a living one does.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 500 sat, as agreed.
o_id: sweet_revenge_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: sweet_revenge_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Five hundred. She'll sue. She'll lose. Have a good evening.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'bd_master', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 500)
effect: SetFlag('sweet_revenge_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: My people say she's still at the commune with her master. You were there. Interesting.
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: You're not in my calendar.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: My time costs more than yours.
effect: EndConversation
